@startuml SeqFCM
title Sequence Diagram — Firebase Cloud Messaging (Token Registration & Notification Dispatch)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 160
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness 1.5

actor       "Driver"                    as DRIVER
participant "EvChargeMessagingService"  as FCM_SVC
participant "App Backend"               as BACKEND
database    "MySQL Database"            as DB
participant "Firebase Admin SDK"        as ADMIN
participant "FCM Service (Google)"      as FCM
actor       "Operator"                  as OPERATOR
participant "Operator Dashboard"        as DASH

== Phase 1: FCM Token Registration ==

DRIVER  -> BACKEND   : POST /api/app/auth/login
BACKEND --> DRIVER   : { jwt, user }
FCM_SVC -> FCM_SVC   : onNewToken(fcmToken)\n[Firebase SDK callback on login\nor token rotation]
FCM_SVC -> BACKEND   : POST /api/app/auth/fcm-token\n{ token: fcmToken }
BACKEND -> DB        : UPDATE app_users\nSET fcm_token = ?\nWHERE app_user_id = ?
DB      --> BACKEND  : OK
BACKEND --> FCM_SVC  : 200 OK

== Phase 2: Operator Triggers Notification ==

OPERATOR -> DASH     : Select notification type,\ntitle, body, city filter
DASH     -> BACKEND  : POST /api/notifications/send\n{ type, title, body, stationId?, cityFilter? }

BACKEND  -> DB       : Query relevant FCM tokens\nbased on type + targeting rules
DB       --> BACKEND : [ fcmToken1, fcmToken2, ... ]

BACKEND  -> ADMIN    : admin.messaging()\n.sendEachForMulticast({ tokens, notification })
ADMIN    -> FCM      : Dispatch to FCM Service

alt Delivery successful
  FCM     --> ADMIN   : { successCount, failureCount }
  ADMIN   --> BACKEND : Multicast result
  BACKEND -> DB       : INSERT INTO notifications\n{ type, title, body, recipients_count }
  DB      --> BACKEND : OK
  BACKEND --> DASH    : { sent: true, recipientsCount }
  DASH    -> OPERATOR : Show delivery confirmation

  == Phase 3: Notification Received on Device ==

  FCM     -> FCM_SVC  : onMessageReceived(message)
  FCM_SVC -> FCM_SVC  : Route to notification channel\n(station_updates / tariff_updates\n/ announcements)
  FCM_SVC -> FCM_SVC  : Persist to SharedPreferences\nas JSON entry
  FCM_SVC -> DRIVER   : Display push notification

  DRIVER  -> FCM_SVC  : Open NotificationsScreen
  FCM_SVC -> DRIVER   : Show chronological\nnotification history

else FCM delivery failure
  FCM     --> ADMIN   : Error / invalid token
  ADMIN   --> BACKEND : Failure response
  BACKEND -> DB       : Log failed delivery
  BACKEND --> DASH    : { sent: false, error }
end

@enduml
